     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap activitydefinition-code-to-observation-code</b></p><a name=\"activitydefinition-code-to-observation-code\"> </a><a name=\"hcactivitydefinition-code-to-observation-code\"> </a><p>Mapping from <a href=\"ValueSet-ehealth-activitydefinition-code.html\">Activity Definition Code</a> to <a href=\"ValueSet-ehealth-observation-codes.html\">Observation Codes</a></p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html\">Sundhedsvæsenets klassifikationssystem (SKS)</a> to <a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html\">NPU DK</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Source Concept Details</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Target Concept Details</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> from <a href=\"CodeSystem-urn-oid-1.2.208.176.2.4.html\" title=\"urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.4\">Sundhedsvæsenets klassifikationssystem (SKS)</a></td><td/><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> from <a href=\"CodeSystem-1.2.208.176.2.1--20190829.html\" title=\"urn:oid:1.2.208.176.2.1\">NPU DK</a></td><td/></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">ZZ3170</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Hjemmeblodtryksmåling udført af patienten</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#specializes\" title=\"specializes\">has specialization</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DNK05472</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Blodtryk systolisk;Arm</td><td>Should really be specializes but igpublisher turns into narrower (which requires a comment)</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-top-style: none; border-left-width: 0px\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#specializes\" title=\"specializes\">has specialization</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">DNK05473</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Blodtryk diastolisk;Arm</td><td>Should really be specializes but igpublisher turns into narrower (which requires a comment)</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a> to <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Source Concept Details</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Target Concept Details</b></td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\" title=\"http://loinc.org\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></td><td/><td colspan=\"2\"><b>Codes</b> from <a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/6.5.0/CodeSystem-v3-loinc.html\" title=\"http://loinc.org\">Logical Observation Identifiers, Names and Codes (LOINC)</a></td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">72287-6</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-bottom-style: none\">Wound size panel</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#specializes\" title=\"specializes\">has specialization</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">39126-8</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Length of Wound</td></tr><tr><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px; border-top-style: none; border-bottom-style: none\"/><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R5/codesystem-concept-map-relationship.html#specializes\" title=\"specializes\">has specialization</a></td><td style=\"border-right-width: 0px\">39125-0</td><td style=\"border-left-width: 0px\">Width of Wound</td></tr><tr